    "   \"id\": \"5e09eb046915482b\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Stations excluded from evaluation, by variable\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Marks every station×variable pair dropped by `DROP_SV` (see common.py) with\\n\",\n",
    "    \"an X on the map: **black** = missing in both train and test (>50%),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**white** = missing in train only (sensor added after 2021, present in\\n\",\n",
    "    \"test), **grey** = missing in test only (no such pair exists in the current\\n\",\n",
    "    \"data — kept for completeness), **orange** = present in both splits but\\n\",\n",
    "    \"excluded for a data-quality reason (BIZ/pressure, systematic sensor drift),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"not for missingness.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
